y law Escape as well  now to be fair so far we don't actually  know if law and Blackbeard will be at  beehive Island for sure when GARP  arrives there with the members of sort  after all last time we saw them they  were still fighting but based on  everything we've discussed so far it  would be really strange if GARP and  Blackbeard wouldn't Clash after all of  this and so the question right now of  course is whether or not GARP has a  chance to win this thing I mean we all  know that Blackbeard has long been set  up as Luffy's main rival in the chase  for the one piece so similar to law the  chances of Garb actually defeating  Blackbeard seem fairly slim simply based  on the fact that the structure of the  story seems to suggest a battle between  Luffy and blackbeards now that being  said though GARP has been set up to be  one of the strongest Marines all  throughout the story Who has fought on a  level with the likes of rocks Roger  Whitebeard and Shiki we also saw that  Rayleigh was able to at least scare  Blackbeard off and I would think that  Garb would be at least a strong Israeli  if not stronger than him and so should  GARP and Blackbeard actually fight then  I would expect it to be one of the best  fights we've seen in the entire story so  far given that Oda doesn't off screen  most of it again as he really likes to  do with these types of fights and uh  seeing guard fighting at full strength  is something that I have been wishing  for for a long long time and I'm sure he  could leave quite the impact on  blackbeards however should that quote  from Oda about the unexpected battle  actually turn out to be about this  specific fight I think GARP has a pretty  big death Flack above his head and uh  let's be real GARP dying at the hands of  Blackbeard would be an even more  traumatic experience for us than Ace's  death was I mean GARP has been one of  the most beloved and respected  characters among fans and it would be  another incredibly traumatic event for  