brary of O'Hara and  brought it to elbaf and according to Kit  he knows about the last Road poneglyph  and that makes a lot of sense when you  think about it because it really  wouldn't be that big of surprise if the  Librarians of O'Hara had somehow gotten  their hands on a road Pony glyph now  that would of course give kid a major  Head Start in the race for love tale  however as you might know I'm also a big  believer in the theory that elbaf is  part of shanks's territory and under his  rule which would be pretty fitting law  vs Blackbeard and Kid vs Shanks there  are actually a lot of reasons why Shanks  is most likely on elbaf and why the  straw hats will have to go there next as  well if you're curious go check out that  video right here thank you so much for  watching my videos in 2022 and I hope to  see you around next year as well let me  know what you want to see on the channel

